---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="hero">
    <img src="/Myth0-Games-Site/banner.png" alt="Myth0 Games" />
  </section>

  <main class="content">
	<hr class="line-break">
	<h1>About Myth0 Games</h1>
    <p>
      Myth0 Games is an independent game development studio focused on creating immersive fantasy worlds and practical 
	  development tools. From games to open-source projects and Asset Store tools, every project is built with 
	  a focus on quality, performance, and ease of use.
    </p>
	<hr class="line-break">
	<h1>Projects</h1>
	<section class="showcase">
		<figure class="showcase-item">
			<img src="/Myth0-Games-Site/stormfall_banner.png" alt="Stormfall Banner" />

			<figcaption>
				<h3>Stormfall</h3>
				<br>
				<p>
					Stormfall (title tentative) is a 2D metroidvania action-platformer drawing inspiration from legendary fantasy
					stories and other great 2D platformers.

					This is the flagship project of Myth0 Games. It is currently under heavy development.
					<br>
					<br>
					You can play an early demo now on <a href="https://myth0.itch.io/stormfall">Itch.io</a>!
				</p>
			</figcaption>
		</figure>

		<figure class="showcase-item">
			<img src="/Myth0-Games-Site/layerfx_banner.png" alt="LayerFX Banner" />

			<figcaption>
				<h3>LayerFX</h3>
				<br>
				<p>
					LayerFX is a powerful tool for Unity 6 URP, allowing users to render fullscreen effects to specific layers only.
					It provides fine control for post-processing and VFX that isn't found in Unity's default systems. 
					<br>
					<br>
					LayerFX is coming soon to the Unity Asset Store! Visit 
					the <a href="https://myth0-games.github.io/LayerFXDocs/">LayerFX Website</a> to learn more.
				</p>
			</figcaption>
		</figure>

		<figure class="showcase-item">
			<img src="/Myth0-Games-Site/je_banner.png" alt="Journey's End Banner" />

			<figcaption>
				<h3>Journey's End</h3>
				<br>
				<p>
					Prior to focusing on original game development, Myth0 Games created mods for other games, including the 
					Journey's End mod.
					Journey's End is a mod for Minecraft Forge 1.21 that overhauls the End dimension, adding massive,
					procedurally-generated dungeons full of dangerous new enemies.
					<br>
					<br>
					You can play the mod now on <a href="https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeys-end">CurseForge</a> or <a href="https://modrinth.com/mod/journeys-end-mod">Modrinth</a>!
				</p>
			</figcaption>
		</figure>
	</section>

	<hr class="line-break">

	<h1>Development Tools</h1>

	<ul class="tools">
		<li>Unity</li>
		<li>C#</li>
		<li>Universal Render Pipeline (URP)</li>
		<li>Shader Graph</li>
		<li>HLSL</li>
		<li>Minecraft Forge</li>
		<li>Java</li>
		<li>Krita</li>
		<li>Fusion 360</li>
		<li>DaVinci Resolve</li>
	</ul>

	<hr class="line-break">

	<h1>Our Goal</h1>
	<p>Our goal is to create game worlds that players will want to return to time and time again. We believe the best games 
		combine compelling storytelling, memorable music, thoughtful design, and strong technical foundations. Great 
		games are one of the highest forms of interactive art.
	</p>

	<hr class="line-break">

	<h1>Contact</h1>
	<p>
		<strong>You can contact Myth0 Games at:</strong>
		<br>
		<br>
		<a href="mailto:myth07games@gmail.com">myth07games@gmail.com</a>
	</p>

	<hr class="line-break">
  </main>
</Layout>